  "emi.info.unseen_world.effigy_patriarch.0": "The Effigy of the Auric Patriarch takes 2 Auric Keys and needs 4 lit seals.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.effigy_patriarch.1": "Auric Keys are the reward of gripping ordeals at auric ordeal spawners.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.effigy_seals.0": "A seal is a lit engraved brick 2 blocks from the effigy core, at the middle of a pedestal side, with its arrow pointing into the pedestal.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.effigy_seals.1": "A brick takes power from a gripping stone behind its arrow and passes it on along the arrow. Land on a brick to turn it clockwise; sneak while landing to turn it back.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.effigy_seals.2": "With every key inserted and enough seals lit, the statue rumbles for 5 seconds and the boss steps out. Click with an empty hand to see progress; sneak-click to take a key back.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.effigy_seals.3": "When the boss dies, the statue re-forms and the effigy accepts keys again.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.effigy_sentinel.0": "The Effigy of the Eclipse Sentinel takes 2 Abyssal Keys and needs 3 lit seals.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.effigy_sentinel.1": "Abyssal Keys are the reward of gripping ordeals at abyssal ordeal spawners.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.effigy_warrior.0": "The Effigy of the Warrior of Chimeric Darkness takes 2 Gripcrystal Keys and needs 2 lit seals.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.effigy_warrior.1": "Gripcrystal Keys are the reward of gripping ordeals at gripcrystal ordeal spawners.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.gripping_cure.0": "A placed griptonite lantern removes Gripping from players near it.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.gripping_cure.1": "Walk up to an ordeal spawner with 10 or more seconds of Gripping and the spawner absorbs all of it, starting a gripping ordeal.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.gripping_cure.2": "Use griptonite on a gripping creature to free it. The griptonite loses durability.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.gripping_cure.3": "If the server allows it, Gripping also fades by itself over time.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.gripping_spread.0": "Gripping is a parasite crystal. Creatures in the gripping-immune tag never catch it.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.gripping_spread.1": "Gripcrystal warts and gripping stones are where it starts: stay close to them and it takes hold.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.gripping_spread.2": "Gripping Gloomwhales, Eclipsed Acolytes and the bosses of the Chimeric Darkness add Gripping with some of their attacks.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.gripping_spread.3": "Mobs from a gripping ordeal add 4 seconds with every hit. A raised shield stops it.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.ordeal_spawner.0": "An ordeal starts 3 seconds after a survival player comes within 14 blocks in line of sight.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.ordeal_spawner.1": "Normal ordeal: 6 mobs plus 2 per extra player (up to 4 players), 2 alive at once plus 1 per extra player, one every 2 seconds. Cooldown: 20 minutes.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.ordeal_spawner.2": "The first half of the mobs is the wave 1 creature, the second half the wave 2 creature. Every player who took part gets their own reward roll.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.ordeal_spawner.3": "Gripping ordeal: 10 mobs plus 3 per extra player, 3 alive at once plus 1 per extra player, one every second, and each hit adds 4 seconds of Gripping. Its reward includes the spawner's boss key. Cooldown: about 27 minutes, then the spawner turns back to normal.",
  "emi.info.unseen_world.ordeal_spawner.4": "Leave for 30 seconds and the remaining mobs vanish and the ordeal resets.",
